#: mplayerthumbscfg.cpp:71
msgid ""
"Cleaning the cache will delete all the previously generated thumbnail.\n"
"Since the cache is unique, also other file type thumbnails will be deleted.\n"
"Do you really want to clean up the cache?"
msgstr ""
"Se limpa a caché borrará todas as miniaturar creadas anteriormente.\n"
"Xa que a caché é única, tamén se borrarán as miniaturas de outros tipos de "
"ficheiros.\n"
"Desexa realmente limpar a caché?"

